## ⚠️ Security Note

This application is intended for **educational purposes and password generation**.

Generated passwords should be handled carefully. Although the application does not save password history to files, passwords are temporarily displayed in the application and copied to the system clipboard.

For highly sensitive accounts, users should consider using a trusted password manager.

